WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Start on hands and knees.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Slide the right arm under the left armpit, resting the shoulder.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Optional: open the left arm to the sky.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Breathe into the upper back.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Switch sides.
